是的，可以！
分開寫的時候，只要改用 COUNT(DISTINCT p.CustomerNo)，就能確保只算唯一的 CustomerNo，避免 JOIN 造成的重複計算。
✅ 分開寫的正確版本（推薦這樣改）
1. Total（總數） （這個本來就沒問題）
WITH PURE_TS AS
(
    SELECT CustomerNo    
    FROM VERIFY..BSA_SUB_CUST_FACT
    EXCEPT
    SELECT a.CustomerNo    
    FROM BSA_SUB_CUST_FACT a
    JOIN CIF_Migrate_Mapping_TEMP b ON a.cif_key = b.NEW_CIF_KEY
)
SELECT COUNT(*) AS Total_Count FROM PURE_TS;
2. Same（一樣的數量）
WITH PURE_TS AS
(
    SELECT CustomerNo    
    FROM VERIFY..BSA_SUB_CUST_FACT
    EXCEPT
    SELECT a.CustomerNo    
    FROM BSA_SUB_CUST_FACT a
    JOIN CIF_Migrate_Mapping_TEMP b ON a.cif_key = b.NEW_CIF_KEY
)
SELECT COUNT(DISTINCT p.CustomerNo) AS Same_Count
FROM PURE_TS p
LEFT JOIN VERIFY..BSA_SUB_CUST_FACT v ON p.CustomerNo = v.CustomerNo
LEFT JOIN BSA_SUB_CUST_FACT b ON p.CustomerNo = b.CustomerNo
WHERE ISNULL(CAST(v.IsSARFiled AS INT),0) = ISNULL(CAST(b.IsSARFiled AS INT),0);
3. Different（不一樣的數量）
WITH PURE_TS AS
(
    SELECT CustomerNo    
    FROM VERIFY..BSA_SUB_CUST_FACT
    EXCEPT
    SELECT a.CustomerNo    
    FROM BSA_SUB_CUST_FACT a
    JOIN CIF_Migrate_Mapping_TEMP b ON a.cif_key = b.NEW_CIF_KEY
)
SELECT COUNT(DISTINCT p.CustomerNo) AS Different_Count
FROM PURE_TS p
LEFT JOIN VERIFY..BSA_SUB_CUST_FACT v ON p.CustomerNo = v.CustomerNo
LEFT JOIN BSA_SUB_CUST_FACT b ON p.CustomerNo = b.CustomerNo
WHERE ISNULL(CAST(v.IsSARFiled AS INT),0) <> ISNULL(CAST(b.IsSARFiled AS INT),0);

為什麼要加 `COUNT(DISTINCT p.CustomerNo)`？
因為 LEFT JOIN 後如果右邊表有重複的 CustomerNo，原本的 COUNT(*) 會把同一筆客戶算很多次。 加上 DISTINCT 後，就只計算唯一的 CustomerNo，結果就會跟 Total 一致。

建議： 先用上面修改後的 Same_Count 和 Different_Count 再跑一次，看看現在三個數字是否一致。
跑完後告訴我結果，如果 Still 不一致，或你想一次看到「不一樣的那些 CustomerNo 清單」，我再幫你加上。
